{"unit_id":"aqiu817__dsh-plugin-auto-retry#card-zh","repo":"aqiu817/dsh-plugin-auto-retry","commit":"3dcc235d2853d977d68fff7ebdd4433caf026766","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-auto-retry 是面向 DSH Web 的模型请求恢复插件。它接入 agent/request-error 流程，在宿主重试执行器放弃失败后，按可配置的错误码与额外次数决定是否继续尝试；宿主已经重试时会接续其退避曲线，并记录重试事件。它还在对话轮次尾部提供可折叠面板，展示原生转录未保留的错误详情，并在插件页提供配置表单。适合希望处理暂时性模型请求失败并查看完整错误信息的 DSH 用户。无需单独填写 API 密钥，模型服务仍由 DSH 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:254-276","lib/index.js:298-326","client.js:958-976"]}
{"unit_id":"aqiu817__dsh-plugin-auto-retry#card-en","repo":"aqiu817/dsh-plugin-auto-retry","commit":"3dcc235d2853d977d68fff7ebdd4433caf026766","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-auto-retry extends DSH model retries after the built-in handler declines a failure. It continues backoff and adds a collapsible chat panel with full error details. DSH Web users can configure retry codes and limits; model credentials remain managed by DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:254-276","lib/index.js:298-326","client.js:958-976"]}
